    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a remote island nourished by a magical forest, Pep, a sweet and curious little pig, is waiting for you to embark on an adventure together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pep, a Pig&quot; is a game designed to help you disconnect and immerse yourself in a world of vibrant and peaceful nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your loyal companion Pep follows you every step of the way, gazing at you with bright eyes and joyful little hops as you progress through your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you'll gather resources that allow you to unlock new areas of this whimsical world, slowly uncovering the mysterious past of Pep. You can pet your adorable pig, play together, and dress him up with cute accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The areas to explore are wonderfully varied: from lush meadows and flower-filled gardens to babbling brooks and golden wheat fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each location has unique details waiting to be discovered!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641880/extras/0b04c73208fc8443799e0c580f1fe477.webp?t=1755164046\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a leisurely game where you can relax, enjoy the scenery, and connect with Pep in every moment. It's perfect for those seeking a cozy and heartwarming experience, ideal for losing track of time in a world crafted with love and tranquility.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a remote island nourished by a magical forest, Pep, a sweet and curious little pig, is waiting for you to embark on an adventure together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pep, a Pig&quot; is a game designed to help you disconnect and immerse yourself in a world of vibrant and peaceful nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your loyal companion Pep follows you every step of the way, gazing at you with bright eyes and joyful little hops as you progress through your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you'll gather resources that allow you to unlock new areas of this whimsical world, slowly uncovering the mysterious past of Pep. You can pet your adorable pig, play together, and dress him up with cute accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The areas to explore are wonderfully varied: from lush meadows and flower-filled gardens to babbling brooks and golden wheat fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each location has unique details waiting to be discovered!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641880/extras/0b04c73208fc8443799e0c580f1fe477.webp?t=1755164046\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a leisurely game where you can relax, enjoy the scenery, and connect with Pep in every moment. It's perfect for those seeking a cozy and heartwarming experience, ideal for losing track of time in a world crafted with love and tranquility.</p>",
